eline.png%2Frevision%2Flatest%2Fscale-to-width-down%2F450%3Fcb%3D20190804015724","type":"image"},{"content":"\n\t\t\t","type":"text"},{"content":"The first tank is located next to the bunker northern of the resort, near the river.","type":"text"},{"content":"\n\t\t","type":"text"}],[{"content":"\n\t\t\t","type":"text"},{"alt":"The second tank is located on the road that goes from the tunnel extraction through the village.","previewSrc":"/api/wiki/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fstatic.wikia.nocookie.net%2Fescapefromtarkov_gamepedia%2Fimages%2Fa%2Fa7%2FFirsttankshoreline.png%2Frevision%2Flatest%3Fcb%3D20190804020512","src":"/api/wiki/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fstatic.wikia.nocookie.net%2Fescapefromtarkov_gamepedia%2Fimages%2Fa%2Fa7%2FFirsttankshoreline.png%2Frevision%2Flatest%2Fscale-to-width-down%2F450%3Fcb%3D20190804020512","type":"image"},{"content":"\n\t\t\t","type":"text"},{"content":"The second tank is located on the road that goes from the tunnel extraction through the village.","type":"text"},{"content":"\n\t\t","type":"text"}],[{"content":"\n\t\t\t","type":"text"},{"alt":"The third tank is located on the bridge between the power station and the weather station. You can find it by following the dirt road.","previewSrc":"/api/wiki/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fstatic.wikia.nocookie.net%2Fescapefromtarkov_gamepedia%2Fimages%2F4%2F47%2FThirdtankshoreline.png%2Frevision%2Flatest%3Fcb%3D20190804015014","src":"/api/wiki/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fstatic.wikia.nocookie.net%2Fescapefromtarkov_gamepedia%2Fimages%2F4%2F47%2FThirdtankshoreline.png%2Frevision%2Flatest%2Fscale-to-width-down%2F450%3Fcb%3D20190804015014","type":"image"},{"content":"\n\t\t\t","type":"text"},{"content":"The third tank is located on the bridge between the power station and the weather station. You can find it by following the dirt road.","type":"text"},{"content":"\n\t\t","type":"text"}]],"ordered":false,"type":"list"},{"items":[[{"content":"Tigr Safari","href":"/quest/:mode/tigr-safari","title":"Tigr Safari","ty